    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Condo</i> is a short, moody experience about wandering, distracting yourself, and getting lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to sleep, you navigate a quiet condo complex. There's no rush - just you, the building, its inhabitants, and the  stories they hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resolution</strong>: 1440x1080 (4:3 aspect ratio).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> \u00a0\u2248 30 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding all events unlocks an ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush. No destination. \u2665</p></li></ul>",
